WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:09.622
AI Haeba runs on your own Google API key.
Let's get one and connect it, step by step.

00:00:10.522 --> 00:00:19.578
First, search Google for "Google AI Studio" and click the first result.
Sign in with your Google account.

00:00:20.478 --> 00:00:27.470
Click "API Keys" in the left menu,
then "Create API key" at the top right.

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:35.938
Give the key a name you'll recognize and click "Create key".
Leave the project as it is.

00:00:36.838 --> 00:00:44.310
When the key appears, click "Copy key".
Keys start with AQ. or AIza.

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:51.218
The new key shows up in the list: done! Now over to AI Haeba.

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:58.366
Sign in to AI Haeba and click "API key" near the bottom of the right-hand menu.

00:00:59.266 --> 00:01:04.938
Paste the key into the Google Gemini "1st priority" box and click "Apply".

00:01:05.838 --> 00:01:13.358
When you see "Applied" and the key's last four characters,
you're connected. Any charges go to your own Google account.

00:01:14.258 --> 00:01:18.034
Now pick a tool and run it!
